<title>AUSTRALIA: AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES-No tenders.</title>
<headline>AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES-No tenders.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>There were no Australian promissory note tenders on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dealers said that apart from scattered fund interest, short end dealings were subdued.</p>
<p>&quot;People are just sitting on their hands before the jobs numbers,&quot; said one Sydney-based dealer.</p>
<p>The Australian Bureau of Statistics will release March's labour force data at 0130 GMT (11.30 a.m.).</p>
<p>At 0050 GMT (10.50 a.m.), June bill futures were down one point to 93.83.</p>
</text>
